# 10. TARGET FI-E V0.1

| ParameterTarget desain |                                        |
| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| Chemistry              | Iron-air                               |
| Cell voltage           | measured, not assumed                  |
| DC bus                 | **48 V-class**                         |
| AC output              | **230 V / 50 Hz**                      |
| Demonstrator           | **1 kW**                               |
| Storage target         | **10 kWh**                             |
| Operating modes        | Charge / idle / discharge              |
| Input                  | grid/solar DC or AC                    |
| Output                 | DC + AC                                |
| Renewable interface    | Solar PV                               |
| Primary metric         | Wh delivered                           |
| Secondary metrics      | efficiency, cycle life, Fe utilization |

**1 kW × 10 h = 10 kWh** adalah target demonstrasi, bukan klaim performa yang sudah dicapai.

---

# 11. BENCHMARK INDUSTRI

Form Energy mempublikasikan untuk **100-hour iron-air system** planning values sekitar:

- **40–45% AC-AC round-trip efficiency**
- **69–73% charge efficiency**
- **58–62% discharge efficiency**
- **1,500–2,000 equivalent full-power hours/year**
- **15–20 year enclosure lifetime**
- **2%/year energy-capacity degradation**

Angka tersebut adalah **planning assumptions untuk sistem Form 100-hour dan bukan hasil yang otomatis berlaku untuk prototype kita**. ([Form Energy](https://formenergy.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Form-Energy-Navigating-the-Pacific-Northwest-Energy-Challenges-06.26.2024.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com "JUNE 2024
Navigating the Pacific Northwest’s&#x20;
Ener"))

Karena itu V0.1 kita harus **mengukur sendiri**, bukan mengadopsi angka industri sebagai hasil eksperimen.

